          <td colspan="2" height="30" background="newsheader.jpg"><font face="Times New Roman" size="4"><b><font size="5">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;King and Queen Assassinated!! News at 11...</font></b></font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr bgcolor="#330033"> 
          <td width="60%"><font size="2"><i><font face="Verdana">by <A href="javascript:createWindow('memberdetails.asp?id=108','profile','scrollbars,width=550,height=500')"><font color=yellow>Mckenna Stormangel</font></a></font></i></font></td>
          <td width="40%"> 
            <div align="right"><font size="2"><b>Posted: 3/16/2002 1:23:14 PM</b></font></div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td colspan="2">
<font face="Verdana" size="2"><B>SoF took over Chardok and decided the King's room needed an exterminator.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             </B></font><P>
<font face="Verdana" size="2">Once again SoF, made their way into Chardok after the elusive Royal couple. (I have to admit, I was starting to really hate that zone.) But our past experiences finally paid off on our trip to the King's lair. <br><br>We avoided that darn bed bug like the plague and decided to pull him to the library instead. Thanx Matthi. =) It was a tough battle with all the adds, but we pulled through and made our way to his room where we proceeded to pull his wife. Her death was eminent and we stood there in shock, realizing a warrior epic was finally within reach. Grats LUCANE and FALQOUR!!<br><br>Well, the raid team got smaller as lots of folks headed out. Matthi and her group of 6, Falqour and others left the zone and we were left with the decision of trying again or heading out. We had less than 35 peeps left and after talking to Belin decided we would take another shot at the royals. After all, we owed them bigtime. <br><br>So we camped out in the King's room awaiting his return. What a rude awakening. Poor guy didnt even get to take his shoes off before we buried him 6 feet under.<br><br>And the second round on the Queen was flawless. She went down so fast I didnt even have time to land anything but a snare. And what do ya know!! She had another blade!! Grats RAYDER!!!<br><br>Our first two attempts at the Queen and both successful. What a great night for SoF!!<br><br>And here's what we received along with a number of spells:<br><br>Nathsar BP - 18 AC, 6 Str, 6 Agi, 6 Wis, 5 Fr/Dr<br>Awarded to Mahes.<br><br>Nathsar Vambrances - 8 AC, 4 Agi, 4 Dex, 4 Wis, 2 Cr/Dr<br>Awarded to Txbow.<br><br>Argent Protector (2) - 42/49, 10 AC, 10 Str, 10 Wis, 10 Int, 25 HP, 25 Mana<br>Awarded to Maldar and Gooniee.<br><br>Insignia Protector - 20 AC, 10 Wis, 10 Int, 5 Cha, 10 Mr/Fr/Cr, 20 Mana<br>Awarded to Quxeos.<br><br>Haletma looted the 2nd scroll to be MQ'd with another lucky cleric =)<br><br>Congrats SoF!! What a successful raid. =)<br><br>/salute                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       </font>
